@startuml
title CMTAT Factory - overview

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam NoteFontSize 11

actor "Deployer\n<size:10>holds CMTAT_DEPLOYER_ROLE</size>" as Deployer

component "CMTAT factory\n<size:10>AccessControl - deployment registry</size>" as Factory #EEF5FF
component "CMTAT proxy\n<size:10>deployed with CREATE2</size>" as Proxy #F3F3F3
component "CMTAT implementation\n<size:10>shared by every proxy</size>" as Impl #EAF7EE

Deployer --> Factory : deployCMTAT(salt, cmtatArgument)
Factory --> Proxy : CREATE2 - address known in advance
Proxy --> Impl : delegatecall
Factory ..> Impl : encodes initialize(...)

note right of Factory
  Per deployment: incremental id,
  appended to cmtatsList,
  CMTATDeployed event emitted.
end note

note bottom of Impl
  |= Factory |= Proxy |= Implementation |
  | CMTAT_UUPS_FACTORY | ERC1967Proxy | CMTATUpgradeableUUPS |
  | CMTAT_TP_FACTORY | TransparentUpgradeableProxy | CMTATStandardUpgradeable |
  | CMTAT_BEACON_FACTORY | BeaconProxy | CMTATStandardUpgradeable |
  | CMTAT_LIGHT_TP_FACTORY | TransparentUpgradeableProxy | CMTATUpgradeableLight |
  | CMTAT_LIGHT_BEACON_FACTORY | BeaconProxy | CMTATUpgradeableLight |
end note

@enduml
